2. PMDM-derived and modified components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository builds on and modifies PMDM (Pocket-based Molecular Diffusion
Model), which is distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0).

  Original work:
    Huang, L., Xu, T., Yu, Y., Zhao, P., Chen, X., Han, J., Xie, Z., Li, H.,
    Zhong, W., Wong, K.-C., & Zhang, H. (2024).
    "A dual diffusion model enables 3D molecule generation and lead
     optimization based on target pockets."
    Nature Communications, 15, 2657.
    https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-024-46569-1

  Source code:
    GitHub: https://github.com/Layne-Huang/PMDM
    Zenodo: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10631358

  License:
    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes made:
  The original PMDM code has been modified in this repository, including (but
  not limited to) the addition of preference-model-guided sampling and the
  SPO-based fine-tuning procedure. Files or portions derived from PMDM remain
  under CC BY 4.0, with attribution to the original authors as stated above.

